OL,3,GNEWSAPortsmouth misses out on City of
OL,4,ACulture shortlist
OL,5,
OL,6,FPortsmouth has missed out on the UK
OL,7,FCity of Culture 2029 shortlist in the
OL,8,Fyear it celebrates 100 years of city
OL,9,Fstatus.
OL,11,FIt was one of nine places on the
OL,12,Flonglist, but Blackpool, Milton Keynes,
OL,13,FSheffield and Wrexham have been picked
OL,14,Fto compete for the title and a #10m
OL,15,Fprize.
OL,17,FPortsmouth North's MP said she was
OL,18,F"absolutely gutted" and that everyone
OL,19,Fin the city "works so hard".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
