OL,3,GNEWSAPortsmouth misses out on City of
OL,4,ACulture shortlist
OL,5,
OL,6,FCulture Minister Stephanie Peacock said
OL,7,Fit had been "such a competitive field"
OL,8,Fand the shortlisted locations all had
OL,9,F"something unique to offer".
